@startuml
title ADR-030 — Approved delivery, observation and guarded removal
autonumber
actor User
boundary API
control "Pending / Deployment service" as Deploy
database "Scoped repositories / outbox" as DB
control "UC-08 + renderer + secret bridge" as Prepare
boundary "DeliveryProvider" as Provider
boundary "GitPublisher (when required)" as Git
participant "CD controller / target" as Cluster
control "Observation worker" as Observe
control "OwnedObjectRemover" as Remove
User -> API: Save desired delivery (optional, Environment scoped)
API -> DB: CAS selection/version; no runtime effect
User -> API: Preview
API -> Deploy: Plan stored selection, capabilities, baseline
Deploy -> DB: Read snapshot; no provider call
Deploy --> User: Actions + immutable token; transition if manager changed
User -> API: Deploy(token)
API -> Deploy: Admit Environment owner/fence
Deploy -> DB: Claim operation and persist pins
alt ownership transition
  Deploy -> Provider: Release old owner retaining objects
  Provider -> Cluster: Withdraw / verify no writer; retain objects
  Provider --> Deploy: Durable withdrawal proof
  Deploy -> DB: Save per-unit handoff checkpoint
  Deploy -> Provider: Adopt exact artifacts / UID-guarded metadata
  Provider -> Cluster: Register new owner without rerunning Jobs
else ordinary delivery
  Deploy -> Prepare: Dependencies, render, secret readiness
  Prepare --> Deploy: Validated non-secret artifacts and phase graph
  Deploy -> DB: Persist immutable artifacts + pending intents
  loop prerequisite, Job, rollout, route (dependency order)
    Deploy -> Provider: Prepare / Submit(intent, expected revision, fence)
    opt provider requires Git
      Provider -> Git: Publish owned path idempotently
      Git --> Provider: Exact tree / commit receipt
    end
    Provider -> Cluster: Submit pinned revision on exact target
    Provider --> Deploy: Receipt
    Deploy -> DB: Persist receipt / union inventory
    Deploy -> Provider: Observe exact revision and readiness
    Provider -> Cluster: Read controller + owned live objects
    Provider --> Deploy: Complete observation or unknown
  end
end
Deploy -> DB: Commit applied selection / successful state only after proof
loop background observation (read-only)
  Observe -> DB: Lease next unit; use persisted admitted revision
  Observe -> Provider: Observe
  Provider -> Cluster: Scoped read
  Provider --> Observe: Sync / health / drift / timestamp / coverage
  Observe -> DB: Append observation under fence
end
note over Provider, Cluster
Optional autonomous self-heal belongs to CD controller.
No competing direct apply; drafts never submitted.
end note
User -> API: Confirm workload/application removal
API -> Deploy: Admit original applied owner/inventory
Deploy -> Provider: Withdraw(retain)
Provider -> Cluster: Stop management and retire owned control metadata
Provider --> Deploy: Proven withdrawal (otherwise hold)
Deploy -> Remove: Confirmed inventory + original target + UID proofs
Remove -> Cluster: GET ownership; DELETE with UID preconditions
Remove --> Deploy: Absence proof or remaining objects
Deploy -> DB: Persist cleanup; only then permit provider/namespace cleanup
@enduml
